Article 11
The provision of services to victims is carried out with the following principles:
a. Free of charge;
b. Fast;
c. Safe;
d. Empathetic;
e. Non-judgmental;
f. Non-discriminatory;
g. Easily accessible;
h. Confidential; and
i. Integrated.
